# HVS workflow discipline

Substantial HVS work follows PLAN, RESEARCH_PREPARE, CREATE, REVIEW, REFINE, QC, DELIVER. Trivial single edits skip that loop. Workflow state and lessons stay off `.hvsproj`. Rights, FFmpeg, render, and Commander delivery authority stay above this rule. Runtime modules are `lib/media-command/workflow-discipline.ts`, `lib/media-command/lessons/`, and `lib/media-command/verification-classes.ts`.
